  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes I like to play VRChat and another game simultaneously, but if I'm using my Xbox controller for the other game, it will also control VRChat at the same time. This gets a bit annoying if I'm talking to friends, and I start walking away/muting myself etc. at the same time while playing the other game. Could we just have a feature that disables controller input for VRChat, or possibly just check if VRChat is focused before responding to controller input?",
